  <description>Shared base body for the generic airship SITL variants: 10.5 m x 2.5 m ellipsoid hull, gondola, cruciform tail visuals, standard PX4 sensor suite, buoyancy-neutral mass budget. Not meant to be spawned directly - use a propulsion variant (airship, airship_side) that includes it.</description>
